=== arc ===

ARCHIVE COMMANDS:
  arc create <out.zip|tar.gz|tar> <files...>
    Create archive
  arc extract <file> [dest]              Extract archive
  arc list <file>                        List archive contents
Examples:
    arc create backup.zip src Cargo.toml   # Create zip
    arc list backup.zip                    # List contents
    arc extract backup.zip restored        # Extract
=== autoup ===

STARTUP MANAGER (Windows):
  autoup list                            List all startup entries (CU/LM/SF sources)
  autoup add <name> "<cmd>"              Add a startup entry to HKCU
  autoup rm <name>                       Remove a startup entry
  autoup disable <name>                  Disable entry (uses StartupApproved)
  autoup enable <name>                   Re-enable a disabled entry
  [CU]=HKCU [LM]=HKLM [SF]=Startup Folder
Examples:
    autoup list                            # List startup entries
    autoup add ntc "C:\ntc\ntc.exe"        # Add to startup
    autoup rm ntc                          # Remove startup entry
    autoup disable ntc                     # Disable startup entry
=== back ===

BACK COMMAND:
  back [n]                               Go back to parent directory (or n levels)
Examples:
    back                                   # Go back to parent directory
=== backup ===

BACKUP COMMANDS:
  backup create                          Create a backup of current project
  backup list                            List all backups
  backup restore [num]                   Restore a backup (interactive if no num)
  backup restore --choose                Pick a backup from an interactive menu
  backup restore --deleted               Restore only files that were deleted
  backup undo                            Undo the last restore
  backup undo --cls                      Clear undo history (asks confirmation)
  backup undo --force                    Clear undo history (no confirmation)
  backup clear                           Delete ALL backups (asks confirmation)
  backup clear --force                   Delete ALL backups (no confirmation)
  backup recreate                        Clear all + undo + create fresh backup
  backup diff [num]                      Diff current project against a backup
Examples:
    backup create                          # Create a new backup
    backup list                            # List all backups
    backup restore 1                       # Restore backup #1
    backup diff 1                          # Diff against backup #1
=== betw ===

BETW COMMAND:
  betw A:B [file]                        Print lines A to B (1-based inclusive)
Examples:
    betw 10:20 app.log                     # Print lines 10-20 of app.log
