DECODE COMMAND:
  decode b2 <target> [-o <file>]         Binary decode
  decode b10 <target> [-o <file>]        Decimal decode
  decode b64 <target> [-o <file>]        Base64 decode
  decode hex <target> [-o <file>]        Hex decode
  decode url <target> [-o <file>]        URL percent-decode
  decode utf8 <target> [-o <file>]       Escaped bytes to UTF-8
  decode utf16 <target> [-o <file>]      \uNNNN escapes to text
  decode ascii <target> [-o <file>]      Escaped text to ASCII bytes
Examples:
    decode b64 aGVsbG8=                    # Base64 decode
