=== explorer ===

FILE EXPLORER (NFE):
  explorer, nfe [PATH]                   Launch the full-screen terminal file explorer
  h=help, b=parent dir, f=find (hits show their paths)
  g/:=command (file|dir|line), /=live filter, e=editor
  r=rename, d=delete, n=new file, m=new dir, i=hidden toggle
  s=sort mode, S=sort direction (dirs too), F5=refresh
  find: type/Backspace=query, Tab=hjkl/arrows, Enter=open, Esc=back
Examples:
    explorer                               # Launch file explorer in current dir
    nfe ~/projects                         # Open explorer in ~/projects
=== fake ===

fake - generate fake/random data
  fake gen <types> [-n N] [-f fmt] [-s seed] [-o file]
    Generate rows
  formats: json | txt | sql | csv | xlsx  (default: txt table)
  fake gen -g <group> ...                Generate from a saved group
  -u, --unique [cols]                    Unique rows or named columns
  -l, --locale <code>                    Locale pools (en_US en_GB zh_CN th_TH lo_LA)
  fake types                             List every type
  fake types -s <pattern>                Fuzzy-search types
  fake locales                           List --locale codes
  fake group add <name> [alias as type, ...]
    Create a group
  fake group edit <name> [alias as type, ...]
    Replace a group's columns
  fake group rm <name>                   Delete a group
  fake group rnm <old> <new>             Rename a group
  fake group ls [pattern]                List groups (glob, e.g. u*)
  fake group info <name>                 Show a group's columns
  fake group clear [-f]                  Delete every group
  fake group export <name>|--all [-o file]
    Share groups as .ntc_fake
  fake group import <file> [--force] [--prefix p]
    Load groups from a file
  columns: 'alias as type', 'type !' = unique, 'alias as ref:group.col'
  fake help                              Show this help
Examples:
    fake gen name,email,city -n 5          # txt table
    fake gen uuid,age -f json -o rows.json
    fake group add users [username as name, year as age]
    fake gen -g users -f sql -n 10         # INSERT INTO users ...
