  more                                   Show the next page of the last query (inside ndb)
  indexes [table]                        List indexes (inside ndb)
  info                                   Show database file, engine and object counts (inside ndb)
  dbal                                   Manage saved read-only queries: add|run|list|rm (inside ndb)
  exit                                   Close the database and return to ndb [cwd]>
  read-only                              writes are blocked
Examples:
    ndb                                    # then: interface users.db
    ndb                                    # then: tablef users --all
