NSHEET COMMANDS:
  nsheet open <file> [options]           Fullscreen sheet viewer (CSV/TSV/JSON)
  nsheet view <file> [options]           Print sheet as a table (default 50 rows)
  nsheet view <file> --sort <col> [--desc]
    Sort by column
  nsheet view <file> --filter <expr>     Filter rows (col~text, col=n, col>n)
