=== ntpkg ===

PACKAGE MANAGER (ntpkg) + ntpx:
  ntpkg install <lang> [ver] [--force]   Download & install a runtime
  ntpkg uninstall <lang> [ver]           Remove an installed runtime
  ntpkg list                             Show installed runtimes
  ntpkg use <lang> <ver>                 Activate a specific version
  ntpkg which <lang>                     Show path to active runtime
  ntpkg search [keyword]                 Search available packages
  ntpkg info <lang>                      Show package info (version, location, binaries)
  ntpkg available [lang]                 List languages or downloadable versions
  ntpkg help                             Show ntpkg usage
Examples:
    ntpkg install node 18                  # Install Node.js 18
    ntpkg list                             # Show installed runtimes
    ntpkg use node 18                      # Activate Node.js 18
    ntpkg which node                       # Show path to Node.js
    ntpkg search python                    # Search for Python packages
    ntpkg info node                        # Show Node.js package info
    ntpkg available                        # List downloadable languages
    ntpkg help                             # Show ntpkg usage
