  config qsc "#c #s a"                   Set hotkey (Ctrl+Shift+A)
  config qsc off                         Disable QSC hotkey
  qsc listen                             Start QSC daemon (background process)
  qsc stop                               Stop QSC daemon
  qsc status                             Check if QSC daemon is running
  qsc startup on|off                     Register/unregister as startup app
Examples:
    config qsc "#c 0"                      # Set Ctrl+0 hotkey
    qsc listen                             # Start QSC daemon
    qsc status                             # Check daemon status
