=== skill ===

skill - Install AI skills (SKILL.md) into AI harness folders
  skill download <alias|owner/repo[/skill]|url> [--name <name>]
    Download skills from GitHub
  skill add <name> to <harness> [--global]
    Copy a skill (or bundle) into a harness
  skill remove <name> from <harness> [--global]
    Remove a harness copy
  skill delete <name>                    Delete a skill from the library (the opposite of install)
  skill edit <name>                      Open SKILL.md in ntceditor
  skill [list]                           List downloaded bundles and their harness copies
  skill list --all                       List every installed skill, not just bundles
  skill avail                            List the skills ntc supports
  skill info <harness>                   Show the skills a harness folder contains
  skill sub <name> [ls]                  Show the skills inside an installed bundle
  skill help                             Show skill usage
Examples:
    skill download superpowers             # 15 skills from obra/superpowers
    skill download frontenddev             # only frontend-design from anthropics/skills
    skill add superpower to opencode       # .opencode/skills in the current folder
    skill add brainstorming to claude --global # ~/.claude/skills
    skill remove superpowers from opencode # keep the library copy
    skill download --url https://github.com/obra/superpowers # same as the alias
    skill avail                            # superpowers, frontenddev, mcp-builder, sentry-fix-issues, ...
    skill info opencode                    # what .opencode/skills currently holds
    skill sub superpowers ls               # every skill inside the superpowers bundle
    skill download --url <url> --name my-skill # install it under a different name
