TOTAL LINE COMMANDS:
  tl file <path>                         Count lines in a single file
  tl ext <ext> [-s <-n|-l|-r>]           Show all <ext> files and their total lines (respects igcare, sortable)
  tl dir <path> [-s <-n|-l|-r>]          Show supported extensions and total lines in directory (sortable)
  tl ext|dir <target> -s <-n|-l|-r>      Sort: -n normal, -l by line (small to big), -r reverse (big to small)
Examples:
    tl file main.rs                        # Count lines in main.rs
    tl ext .rs                             # Count lines in all .rs files
    tl dir .                               # Count lines in current directory
    tl ext .rs -s -r                       # List .rs files sorted by lines, big to small
